        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "Compile Error To Know",
          "items": [
            "await is only allowed inside async functions and blocks",
            "Cause: `.await` written in a plain `fn`",
            "Fix: make the fn `async`, or `block_on` at the edge"
