        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "select! Races And Drops"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`tokio::select!` returns the first ready branch",
            "It DROPS the rest — read the cancel-safety table",
            "In a loop, use `&mut fut` or a pinned future",
            "Otherwise each iteration restarts the branch from scratch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "select! In A Loop"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "rust",
          "lines": [
            "let sleep = time::sleep(dur);",
            "tokio::pin!(sleep);",
            "loop { select! {",
            "  _ = &mut sleep => break,",
            "  m = rx.recv() => handle(m),",
            "} }"
          ],
          "note": "&mut keeps one deadline, not N"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Fan Out, In Parallel"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "rust",
          "lines": [
            "let mut set = JoinSet::new();",
            "for u in urls {",
            "  set.spawn(fetch(u));",
            "}",
            "while let Some(r) =",
            "  set.join_next().await { .. }"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Each task may run on a ==different core==",
            "Results arrive in **completion** order, not spawn order",
            "Dropping a `JoinSet` aborts every task still inside"
